ved_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T19:52:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T11:59:58Z","body":"Updated to 13.0.1 and switched rendering for the most non-color glyphs to use HarfBuzz as well.\r\n\r\n- `msdf == true` → rasterized by msdfgen.\r\n- `aa == FONT_ANTIALIASING_NONE` or `aa == FONT_ANTIALIASING_LCD` or bitmap only font or FreeType stroker generated outlines → rasterized by FreeType.\r\n- else (both color and monochrome vector glyphs with `aa == FONT_ANTIALIASING_GRAY`) → rasterized by HarfBuzz.\r\n\r\nRasterization performance seems to be in the range of same (small size monochrome glyph) to about 1.7 faster (large color glyphs).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017220650/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4080786623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117149#issuecomment-4080786623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117149","id":4080786623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zO9y_","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":